<img height="283" src="img/fujitsubo031_small.jpg" width="378" /></a><a href="img/fujitsubo032.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/fujitsubo032_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">Aは組み立て式。</td></tr>
